# Standard bug fix

- Work the **existing** GitHub issue. Never open a duplicate.
- Comment on the issue three times with the Bug Fix Summary template from `/standard-bug-fix`: hypothesis, debugging notes, then the fix PR.
- Branch is `demo/bug-<issue-number>-<short-slug>`. The PR body says `Fixes #<issue-number>`. Never merge it.
- Never put full loan numbers, SSNs, or account numbers in a comment or PR.
